msgid ""
"### Hardware and software stack {: #installation-hardware-software-stack }"
msgstr "### 硬件和软件栈 {: #installation-hardware-software-stack }"

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend runs on a layered hardware and software stack. The following "
"overview shows how the main runtime components fit together."
msgstr "vLLM Ascend 运行在分层的硬件和软件栈之上。以下概述展示了主要运行时组件如何协同工作。"

msgid "??? note \"Hardware and software stack overview\""
msgstr "??? note \"硬件和软件栈概述\""

msgid ""
"<p align=\"center\">\n"
"      <img src=\"../assets/hardware-software-stack-overview.png\" alt=\"vLLM Ascend hardware and software stack\" width=\"70%\">\n"
"    </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\">\n"
"      <img src=\"../assets/hardware-software-stack-overview.png\" alt=\"vLLM Ascend 硬件和软件栈\" width=\"70%\">\n"
"    </p>"

msgid ""
"The following hardware and software stack is validated together for this "
"release:"
msgstr "以下硬件和软件栈已针对此版本进行联合验证："

msgid "???+ important \"Validated hardware and software stack\""
msgstr "???+ important \"已验证的硬件和软件栈\""

msgid "| Layer | Component | Validated version / requirement | Role |"
msgstr "| 层级 | 组件 | 已验证版本/要求 | 作用 |"

msgid ""
"    | Runtime environment | Python | `{{ release_image_python_version }}` | "
"Python version used by the validated release image |"
msgstr ""
"    | 运行时环境 | Python | `{{ release_image_python_version }}` | "
"已验证发布镜像使用的Python版本 |"

msgid ""
"    | Host enablement | Ascend HDK | `{{ release_hdk_version }}` | Driver "
"and firmware requirements for the selected CANN release |"
msgstr ""
"    | 主机使能 | Ascend HDK | `{{ release_hdk_version }}` | 所选CANN版本对应的驱动和固件要求 |"

msgid ""
"    | Ascend runtime | CANN Toolkit + Ops | `{{ release_cann_version }}` | "
"Ascend user-space runtime, including the CANN Toolkit and hardware-specific "
"Ops packages |"
msgstr ""
"    | 升腾运行时 | CANN Toolkit + Ops | `{{ release_cann_version }}` | "
"升腾用户态运行时，包括CANN Toolkit和特定硬件的Ops包 |"

msgid ""
"    | Ascend runtime | NNAL | `{{ release_nnal_version }}` | Provides "
"`libatb.so` and ATB runtime capabilities |"
msgstr ""
"    | 升腾运行时 | NNAL | `{{ release_nnal_version }}` | 提供 `libatb.so` 和ATB运行时能力"
" |"

msgid ""
"    | Framework | PyTorch | `{{ release_pytorch_version }}` | Tensor "
"framework used by vLLM |"
msgstr "    | 框架 | PyTorch | `{{ release_pytorch_version }}` | vLLM使用的张量框架 |"

msgid ""
"    | Framework | TorchNPU | `{{ release_torch_npu_version }}` | Connects "
"PyTorch to the Ascend runtime |"
msgstr ""
"    | 框架 | TorchNPU | `{{ release_torch_npu_version }}` | 将PyTorch连接到升腾运行时 |"

msgid ""
"    | Kernel acceleration | Triton Ascend | `{{ "
"release_triton_ascend_version }}` | Used on A2, A3, and 950DT; not used on "
"Atlas 300I DUO or Atlas 200I Pro |"
msgstr ""
"    | 内核加速 | Triton Ascend | `{{ release_triton_ascend_version }}` | "
"用于A2、A3和950DT；不用于Atlas 300I DUO或Atlas 200I Pro |"

msgid ""
"    | Inference engine | vLLM | `{{ release_vllm_version }}` | Model "
"inference engine |"
msgstr "    | 推理引擎 | vLLM | `{{ release_vllm_version }}` | 模型推理引擎 |"

msgid ""
"    | Hardware plugin | vLLM Ascend | `{{ release_vllm_ascend_version }}` | "
"Connects vLLM to the Ascend software stack |"
msgstr ""
"    | 硬件插件 | vLLM Ascend | `{{ release_vllm_ascend_version }}` | "
"将vLLM连接到升腾软件栈 |"

msgid ""
"The versions and requirements in the table above are validated as one "
"compatibility set. Do not arbitrarily mix versions from different releases."
msgstr "上表中的版本和要求作为一个兼容性集合进行验证。请勿随意混用不同发布版本的组件。"

msgid ""
"For another release, select a complete row from [Versioning Policy > Release"
" compatibility matrix](../community/versioning_policy.md#release-"
"compatibility-matrix)."
msgstr ""
"如需其他发布版本，请从[版本策略 > 发布兼容性矩阵](../community/versioning_policy.md#release-"
"compatibility-matrix)中选择完整的行。"

