msgstr "## 安装 {: #installation }"

msgid ""
"### Set up the hardware environment {: #installation-hardware-environment }"
msgstr "### 设置硬件环境 {: #installation-hardware-environment }"

msgid ""
"First, run the following command to confirm that the Ascend NPU firmware and"
" driver are installed correctly:"
msgstr "首先，运行以下命令确认升腾NPU固件和驱动已正确安装："

msgid ""
