"guide](https://docs.docker.com/get-started/get-docker/) if needed."
msgstr ""
"根据您的需求选择一条完整的路径。基于容器的路径需要Docker；如有需要，请参阅[Docker安装指南](https://docs.docker.com/get-"
"started/get-docker/)。"

msgid "| Requirement | Recommended method | Intended users |"
msgstr "| 需求 | 推荐方法 | 目标用户 |"

msgid ""
