msgstr "| 尽快获得可用的vLLM Ascend环境 | **使用预构建镜像** | 首次使用或希望快速部署的用户 |"

msgid ""
"| Install vLLM Ascend on an existing CANN environment | **Install in a CANN "
"environment** | Users of a CANN image or a host/container where CANN is "
