msgstr ""
"| 在现有CANN环境中安装vLLM Ascend | **在CANN环境中安装** | 使用CANN镜像或已安装CANN的主机/容器的用户 |"

msgid ""
"| Install and manage the complete software stack manually | **Install from a"
" base environment** | Advanced users who need custom CANN or Python "
"dependencies, development, or debugging |"
msgstr "| 手动安装和管理完整的软件栈 | **从基础环境安装** | 需要自定义CANN或Python依赖、开发或调试的高级用户 |"

