msgid "### Verify the installation {: #installation-verification }"
msgstr "### 验证安装 {: #installation-verification }"

msgid ""
"Go to [Quick Start > Inference](quick_start.md#quick-start-inference) and "
"run a simple inference test to verify the installation."
msgstr "前往[快速开始 > 推理](quick_start.md#quick-start-inference)并运行一个简单的推理测试来验证安装。"

msgid "## Additional guides {: #installation-more }"
msgstr "## 其他指南 {: #installation-more }"

msgid "### CPU-only build verification {: #installation-cpu-build }"
msgstr "### 仅CPU构建验证 {: #installation-cpu-build }"

msgid ""
"CPU-only build verification checks whether the Python package can be built "
"without a visible Ascend device. It does not verify NPU runtime loading, "
"inference examples, custom kernels, or NPU-specific tests. The build process"
" needs access to CANN Toolkit headers and libraries, so CANN Toolkit must "
"still be installed."
msgstr ""
"仅CPU构建验证用于检查在没有可见升腾设备的情况下能否构建Python包。它不验证NPU运行时加载、推理示例、自定义内核或NPU特定测试。构建过程需要访问CANN"
" Toolkit的头文件和库，因此仍必须安装CANN Toolkit。"

msgid ""
"First, install the Python build backend and native build tools. Editable "
"installations use setuptools-scm directly. If no compatible wheel is "
"available, `arctic-inference` also requires CMake and Ninja:"
msgstr ""
"首先，安装 Python 构建后端和原生构建工具。可编辑安装直接使用 setuptools-scm。如果没有可用的兼容 wheel，`arctic-"
"inference` 还需要 CMake 和 Ninja："

msgid ""
"This workflow verifies only the build and therefore does not install vLLM. "
"To continue testing vLLM and vLLM Ascend together on the main branch, use "
"the exact vLLM commit recorded in `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit` and "
"verify the combined environment as described below."
msgstr ""
"此工作流仅验证构建，因此不会安装 vLLM。若要在 main 分支上继续联合测试 vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend，请使用 "
"`.github/vllm-main-verified.commit` 中记录的精确 vLLM 提交，并按如下所述验证组合环境。"

msgid ""
"In an x86 environment, install the CPU version of PyTorch from the PyTorch "
"CPU index before installing the remaining Ascend dependencies:"
msgstr "在 x86 环境中，在安装其余 Ascend 依赖之前，先从 PyTorch CPU 索引安装 CPU 版本的 PyTorch："

msgid ""
"Before building vLLM Ascend, explicitly set the build target and disable "
"automatic device backend loading:"
msgstr "在构建 vLLM Ascend 之前，请显式设置构建目标并禁用自动设备后端加载："

msgid "???+ important \"Set the correct SOC_VERSION when no NPU is visible\""
msgstr "???+ important \"当没有可见 NPU 时，设置正确的 SOC_VERSION\""

msgid ""
"If `npu-smi` is unavailable in the current environment, set `SOC_VERSION` "
"for the target hardware before running `pip install -e .`:"
msgstr "如果当前环境中没有 `npu-smi`，请在运行 `pip install -e .` 之前为目标硬件设置 `SOC_VERSION`："

msgid ""
"- A2: `export SOC_VERSION=ascend910b1`\n"
"    - A3: `export SOC_VERSION=ascend910_9391`\n"
"    - Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro: `export SOC_VERSION=ascend310p1`\n"
"    - 950DT: `export SOC_VERSION=ascend950dt_9582`"
msgstr ""
"- A2：`export SOC_VERSION=ascend910b1`\n"
"    - A3：`export SOC_VERSION=ascend910_9391`\n"
"    - Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro：`export SOC_VERSION=ascend310p1`\n"
"    - 950DT：`export SOC_VERSION=ascend950dt_9582`"

msgid "???+ tip \"Enable batch invariance\""
msgstr "???+ tip \"启用批处理不变性\""

msgid ""
"Batch invariance requires the `batch_invariant_ops` wheel. Set "
"`VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` before building vLLM Ascend to build and install "
"the wheel as part of the installation flow. For usage instructions, see "
"[Batch Invariance](../user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md)."
msgstr ""
"批处理不变性需要 `batch_invariant_ops` wheel。在构建 vLLM Ascend 之前设置 "
"`VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1`，以便在安装流程中构建并安装该 "
"wheel。有关使用说明，请参阅[批处理不变性](../user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md)。"

msgid ""
"The explicit build dependencies above and `requirements.txt` provide the "
"complete build-system dependencies before the non-isolated editable build "
"starts. `--no-build-isolation` only reuses packages in the current build "
"environment; it cannot make incompatible vLLM, PyTorch, and TorchNPU "
"versions compatible. Before using the environment for actual workloads, run "
"`python -m pip check` and resolve all reported conflicts. If no device is "
"available, skip the inference examples and NPU-specific tests."
msgstr ""
"上述显式构建依赖和 `requirements.txt` 在非隔离可编辑构建开始之前提供了完整的构建系统依赖。`--no-build-"
"isolation` 仅重用当前构建环境中的包；它无法使不兼容的 vLLM、PyTorch 和 TorchNPU "
"版本变得兼容。在将环境用于实际工作负载之前，请运行 `python -m pip check` 并解决所有报告的冲突。如果没有可用设备，请跳过推理示例和"
" NPU 特定测试。"

msgid ""
"Building custom operators requires gcc/g++ later than version 8 and C++17 or"
" later. If you encounter a TorchNPU version conflict when running `pip "
"install -e .`, use `pip install --no-build-isolation -e .` instead to build "
"in the system environment."
msgstr ""
"构建自定义算子需要 gcc/g++ 版本高于 8 以及 C++17 或更高版本。如果在运行 `pip install -e .` 时遇到 "
"TorchNPU 版本冲突，请改用 `pip install --no-build-isolation -e .` 在系统环境中构建。"

msgid ""
"If you encounter other compilation issues, an unexpected compiler may be in "
"use. Before compiling, set `CXX_COMPILER` and `C_COMPILER` to the locations "
"of g++ and gcc, respectively."
msgstr ""
"如果遇到其他编译问题，可能是使用了意外的编译器。编译前，请将 `CXX_COMPILER` 和 `C_COMPILER` 分别设置为 g++ 和 gcc"
" 的位置。"

msgid "### Multi-node deployment {: #installation-multi-node }"
msgstr "### 多节点部署 {: #installation-multi-node }"

msgid ""
"Check the physical links, the status of each node, and inter-node "
"connectivity in order."
msgstr "依次检查物理链路、每个节点的状态以及节点间的连通性。"

msgid "#### Physical link requirements {: #installation-multi-node-physical }"
msgstr "#### 物理链路要求 {: #installation-multi-node-physical }"

msgid ""
"- The physical machines must be on the same LAN and able to communicate with each other.\n"
"- All NPUs must be connected through optical modules, and all connections must be healthy."
msgstr ""
"- 物理机器必须位于同一局域网内，并且能够相互通信。\n"
"- 所有 NPU 必须通过光模块连接，且所有连接必须健康。"

msgid "???+ important \"950DT server precheck\""
msgstr "???+ important \"950DT 服务器预检查\""

msgid ""
"This precheck applies only to 950DT servers. Other server series can skip "
"it."
msgstr "此预检查仅适用于 950DT 服务器。其他服务器系列可以跳过。"

msgid "**Prepare the HiXLEP configuration paths**:"
msgstr "**准备 HiXLEP 配置路径**："

msgid ""
"- When deploying a 950DT inference service, confirm on each server that "
"`/lib/route.conf`, `/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json`, and the `/etc/hixlep` "
"directory that describes the UB link topology exist and are configured "
"correctly. If any item is missing or misconfigured, follow the [HiXLEP "
"configuration file generation "
"guide](https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/A5%20LocalCommRes%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)"
" to generate the required content. Select the \"D2D scenario\" when "
"generating `/etc/hixlep`."
msgstr ""
"- 部署 950DT 推理服务时，请在每台服务器上确认 `/lib/route.conf`、`/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json` 以及描述"
" UB 链路拓扑的 `/etc/hixlep` 目录存在且配置正确。如果任何项目缺失或配置错误，请按照 [HiXLEP "
"配置文件生成指南](https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/A5%20LocalCommRes%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)"
" 生成所需内容。生成 `/etc/hixlep` 时选择“D2D 场景”。"

msgid "#### Check each node {: #installation-multi-node-node-check }"
msgstr "#### 检查每个节点 {: #installation-multi-node-node-check }"

msgid ""
"Run the following commands on each node in order. The command results should"
" be `success`, and the link status should be `UP`:"
msgstr "在每个节点上按顺序运行以下命令。命令结果应为 `success`，链路状态应为 `UP`："

msgid "=== \"A2\""
msgstr "=== \"A2\""

msgid "=== \"A3\""
msgstr "=== \"A3\""

msgid "=== \"950DT\""
msgstr "=== \"950DT\""

msgid ""
"#### Verify inter-node connectivity {: #installation-multi-node-interconnect"
" }"
msgstr "#### 验证节点间连通性 {: #installation-multi-node-interconnect }"

msgid "##### Obtain NPU IP addresses {: #installation-multi-node-npu-ip }"
msgstr "##### 获取 NPU IP 地址 {: #installation-multi-node-npu-ip }"

msgid "=== \"A2\""
msgstr "=== \"A2\""

msgid "=== \"A3\""
msgstr "=== \"A3\""

msgid "=== \"950DT\""
msgstr "=== \"950DT\""

msgid "##### Run a cross-node ping test {: #installation-multi-node-ping }"
msgstr "##### 运行跨节点 ping 测试 {: #installation-multi-node-ping }"

msgid ""
"#### Start containers on each node {: #installation-multi-node-container }"
msgstr "#### 在每个节点上启动容器 {: #installation-multi-node-container }"

msgid ""
"- Use the official vLLM Ascend containers described in [Quick Start > "
"Installation](quick_start.md#quick-start-installation) to quickly prepare "
"consistent multi-node runtime environments."
msgstr ""
"- 使用[快速开始 > 安装](quick_start.md#quick-start-installation)中描述的官方 vLLM Ascend "
"容器，快速准备一致的多节点运行时环境。"

msgid ""
"- Commands for multi-node model serving are outside the scope of this "
"installation guide. Continue with the relevant [Feature "
"Tutorial](../tutorials/features/index.md) or [Model "
"Tutorial](../tutorials/models/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"- "
"多节点模型服务的命令不在本安装指南的范围内。请继续参阅相关的[功能教程](../tutorials/features/index.md)或[模型教程](../tutorials/models/index.md)。"
